"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"89384","synopsis":"【尿意】それは不意にやって来てスバルを恐怖のどん底へと誘った。冷たいものを取りすぎた自分を責めるも時すでに遅く。スバルの限界はもうすぐそこまで来ていた。「完全に終わった…」","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bGF70IGFu8w2mKgxIR5IrF4yV9u.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13426","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100009","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36267","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78461","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"344222","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"89386","synopsis":"おかず、まさかその重要性に気づく日が来るとは夢にも思わなかった。広大な宇宙で一人白米に取り囲まれたスバルがとった決死の行動とは!?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fePCdlCHimpPf7v3YHykp8PSWeB.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13426","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100009","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36267","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78461","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"344222","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"89385","synopsis":"艦長の元で、ティラミスクルー達は一丸となって士気を高めていた。その一方、スバルは別のことで高まっていた。幼い頃からスバルが憧れていた浮かれた聖夜に繰り広げられる出来事とは…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2BJRmPqLsrBvDcVthXxRUNMJsIj.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13426","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100009","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36267","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78461","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"344222","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"89388","synopsis":"遂にティラミスクルー達